**Step 6. Landing** (REC-MERGE slot `FF`): under the lock, `git -C '<root>' merge --ff-only records/b1591`; read back `main` = your commit, `main^{tree}` = the branch tree, `refs-after.txt` differs from refs-before only on `refs/heads/main` and the new `refs/heads/records/b1591`; the new headings once, old headings once each; the three dirty files byte-equal to Step-0 plus your appends; release the lock; `df` last. No push (the root has no remote). REC-MERGE `HOLD`: stop at the commit; the branch is Tuesday's to land.
